{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26582","headline":"送王求 · 姚合","name":"送王求","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"士有经世筹，自无活身策。\n求食道路间，劳困甚徒役。\n我身与子同，日被饥寒迫。\n侧望卿相门，难入坚如石。\n爲农昧耕耘，作商迷贸易。\n空把书卷行，投人买罪责。\n六月南风多，苦旱土色赤。\n坐家心尚焦，况乃远作客。\n羸马出郭门，饯饮晓连夕。\n愿君似醉肠，莫谩生忧戚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26582.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26582","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}